734
00:54:06,464 --> 00:54:08,676
problem by having a hidden state

735
00:54:09,422 --> 00:54:12,484
that encapsulates the sequence that is seen so far.

736
00:54:13,774 --> 00:54:20,304
But the problem is that we have this long-range dependency problem that is actually coming from a deeper problem

737
00:54:21,104 --> 00:54:24,784
called a vanishing gradient problem, which is a problem

738
00:54:25,678 --> 00:54:27,076
when you want to backpropagate.

739
00:54:28,334 --> 00:54:30,372
That just introduces some limitation.

